    "method": "Static gold labels were assigned from the documented briefing and feed contracts before executing the suite. Claude Sonnet 5 supplied an initial blinded review, with Claude Opus 4.6 recommendations available during repository-owner adjudication. DeepSeek V4 Flash supplied a second blinded model pass and GLM 5.2 arbitrated its disagreements. Nemotron Ultra then reviewed the original 49 cases in randomized opaque-ID form: 38 label sets agreed and 11 disagreed; the repository owner adjudicated the disagreements and changed one final label set. GLM 5.2 reviewed six coverage additions in randomized opaque-ID form: three agreed and three disagreed; owner adjudication retained all six label sets. GLM 5.2 later reviewed 24 paired heuristic boundaries and two UTF-32 regressions: 23 agreed and three disagreed; owner adjudication accepted two quotation-label changes. These LLM reviews were used to bootstrap and develop the repository; they are not independent human review. On 2026-08-25, structure-overfilled and selection-category-ambiguity were repaired after an occurrence-blind URL replacement targeted the wrong citation, so those two cases require renewed model review. Full independent human review is recommended before production use.",
